grp +0.0,9.02,+0.0   0,1,0   1.0                                       id:white_pieces       
obj -2.5,0.00,-3.5   0,1,0   1.0   255,250,240   ./models/pawn.obj     parent:white_pieces   mat:0.1,0.7,0.5,120   glass:1.5,0.4
